From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 22:55:44 +0300
Subject: Add customizable avatar corner radius

- avatar corner radius is now driven by a 0-28dp slider instead of the hardcoded fully-round shape
- applies to ImageReceiver-drawn avatars (dialog list, chat header, forum topics), AvatarDrawable placeholder backgrounds, and the profile screen expanded avatar (ProfileActivity/ProfileActivity2)
- optional "unified corner radius" mode applies the same radius to forum avatars instead of their own multiplier
